---
_label: "Keyboard shortcuts"
_icon: icon.zap
description: "Keyboard shortcuts built into the Typedown default theme for navigation, search, and appearance."
---

The default theme provides keyboard shortcuts for common actions. No configuration is needed.

## Navigation

| Shortcut | Action |
| -------- | ------ |
| `←` / `→` | Go to the previous or next page |
| `Alt ←` | Go back in browser history |

## Search

| Shortcut | Action |
| -------- | ------ |
| `/` or `Ctrl K` | Open search |
| `↑` / `↓` | Move between results |
| `Enter` | Open selected result |
| `Esc` | Close search |

## Appearance

| Shortcut | Action |
| -------- | ------ |
| `Ctrl Shift L` | Cycle theme: light → dark → system |

## Sidebar

| Shortcut | Action |
| -------- | ------ |
| `Ctrl B` | Toggle sidebar on mobile |
